<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>You've Been Referred | refermy.life</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #111015;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      color: #e5e5eb;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 32px auto;
      background: #1c1b22;
      border: 1px solid #34313d;
      border-radius: 16px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    }

    .header {
      background-color: #17151d;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #34313d;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 32px 24px;
    }

    .brand {
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 25px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }

    .brand span {
      color: #a78bfa;
    }

    .header-label {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 18px;
      padding: 7px 13px;
      border: 1px solid #51406e;
      border-radius: 20px;
      color: #d6c6ff;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: bold;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .content {
      padding: 36px 32px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      color: #a78bfa;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: bold;
      letter-spacing: 1.8px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h1 {
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 29px;
      line-height: 1.3;
      margin: 12px 0 16px;
    }

    p {
      color: #c1bdca;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin: 0 0 17px;
    }

    .referral-card {
      margin: 26px 0;
      padding: 22px;
      background: #24222c;
      border: 1px solid #3a3548;
      border-radius: 12px;
    }

    .referral-card h2 {
      color: #f0edf6;
      font-size: 17px;
      margin: 0 0 18px;
    }

    .detail {
      margin-top: 16px;
      padding-top: 14px;
      border-top: 1px solid #3a3544;
    }

    .label {
      color: #9993a6;
      font-size: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
    }

    .value {
      color: #f0edf6;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: bold;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    .pill {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 7px 11px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      background: #33264b;
      border: 1px solid #574078;
      color: #d6c6ff;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: #7c3aed;
      border: 1px solid #8b5cf6;
      color: #ffffff !important;
      text-decoration: none !important;
      padding: 14px 24px;
      border-radius: 9px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin: 8px 0 20px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background-color 0.25s ease,
        box-shadow 0.25s ease,
        transform 0.25s ease;
    }

    .button:hover {
      background-color: #6d28d9 !important;
      border-color: #a78bfa !important;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 18px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.35);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .secondary-link {
      color: #b9a0ff;
      font-size: 13px;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    .note {
      padding: 14px 16px;
      border-left: 3px solid #8b5cf6;
      background: #24222a;
      color: #bcb6c9;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .footer {
      background: #17161c;
      border-top: 1px solid #34313d;
      padding: 23px 24px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .footer p {
      color: #918b9e;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin: 0 0 8px;
    }

    .footer a {
      color: #b9a0ff;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .footer a:hover {
      color: #ddd0ff;
      text-decoration: underline;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
      .container {
        margin: 12px;
        border-radius: 12px;
      }

      .content {
        padding: 28px 20px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 24px;
      }

      .button {
        padding: 12px 20px;
      }
    }
  </style>

</head>

<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <div class="brand">refermy<span>.life</span></div>
      <div class="header-label">Direct employee referral</div>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
      <div class="eyebrow">A new professional connection</div>

      <h1>You've been referred, {{candidateName}}!</h1>

      <p>
        Good news! An employee has initiated a direct referral for you on
        refermy.life. This referral was created from your professional
        profile, so you did not need to submit a referral form.
      </p>

      <div class="referral-card">
        <h2>Your referral details</h2>

        <div class="detail" style="margin-top:0; padding-top:0; border-top:0;">
          <div class="label">Position</div>
          <div class="value">{{jobTitle}}</div>
        </div>

        <div class="detail">
          <div class="label">Company</div>
          <div class="value">{{companyName}}</div>
        </div>

        <div class="detail">
          <div class="label">Referred by</div>
          <div class="value">{{employeeName}}</div>
        </div>

        <div class="detail">
          <div class="label">Referral type</div>
          <span class="pill">Direct referral — no form required</span>
        </div>

        {{!-- <div class="detail">
          <div class="label">Current status</div>
          <div class="value">{{statusLabel}}</div>
        </div> --}}
      </div>

      <p>
        You can view the referral details and check its latest status using
        the button below. Make sure your profile and resume are up to date
        so the information available to the referrer is accurate.
      </p>

      <div style="text-align:center;">
        <a href="{{referralUrl}}" class="button">
          View My Referrals
        </a>
      </div>

      <p class="note">
        A direct referral does not guarantee an interview or job offer.
        The employer decides whether to proceed with your application.
      </p>

      <p>
        Keep your profile ready, stay open to opportunities, and continue
        building meaningful professional connections.
      </p>

      <p>
        Best wishes,<br />
        <strong style="color:#302047;">Team refermy.life</strong>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>Helping talent connect with opportunities.</p>
      <p>
        <a href="http://localhost:5173">Visit refermy.life</a>
      </p>
      <p>&copy; 2026 refermy.life. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>

</html>